            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A foldable electronic device (102, 103, 104, 105, 106, or 107) is provided by the present disclosure. The foldable electronic device includes a foldable electronic assembly (10) and a foldable cover (20). The foldable electronic assembly (10) includes a flexible substrate (15). The foldable cover is adhered to the foldable electronic assembly. The foldable cover includes an inner substrate (22), an outer substrate (26) and a first adhesive (24). The first adhesive is disposed between the inner substrate and the outer substrate. The inner substrate (22) has a thickness (T1), the first adhesive (24) has a thickness (T2), the foldable cover (20) has a thickness (T5), and a sum of the thickness (T1) of the inner substrate (22) and the thickness (T2) of the first adhesive (24) is less than the thickness (T5) of the foldable cover (20).</p>
            </abstract>
